// cases_narrow_68k_stub.cla (SE wave 3 Task 1, TEMPORARY): stands in for
// cases_narrow.cla in the emit68k-only core compositions
// (tests/mactest/coregui_files.txt, tests/cg68k/segments.sh) until Task 3
// teaches emit68k the narrow types -- emit68k rejects them until then, and
// runner.cla dispatches caseNarrowInts unconditionally. Task 3 deletes this
// file and puts cases_narrow.cla back in both lists. It FAILs on purpose:
// a stand-in must never report a pass for a case it did not run.
func caseNarrowInts(): TestResult {
    return tkFail("NarrowInts", "narrow integer types are not yet supported by emit68k")
}
